OL,3,GNEWSAU-turn on council leader's free
OL,4,Aparking pledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pledge by Bradford Council's leader
OL,7,Fto introduce free parking across the
OL,8,Fdistrict is currently "not
OL,9,Fdeliverable", the authority has
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FThe council's Reform executive said
OL,13,Fdecision makers were "not yet able to
OL,14,Fimplement" a shake-up of existing
OL,15,Fparking restrictions ` including a free
OL,16,Fhour for drivers at council-owned car
OL,17,Fparks ` that was announced earlier this
OL,18,Fsummer.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
