OL,3,GNEWSAU-turn on council leader's free
OL,4,Aparking pledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt would have reversed, to a large
OL,7,Fextent, an earlier decision by the
OL,8,Fprevious Labour-run administration to
OL,9,Fscrap some free and evening parking.
OL,11,FIan Walker, the council's spokesman for
OL,12,Fneigbourhoods and communities, said: We
OL,13,Fappreciate that residents will be
OL,14,Ffrustrated."
